This package ports learning mechanisms described in "Discovering
state-of-the-art reinforcement learning algorithms" (Oh et al., Nature, 2025)
and implemented in DeepMind's disco_rl (https://github.com/google-deepmind/disco_rl),
Copyright 2025 DeepMind Technologies Limited, licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0. No disco_rl source file is included; the ported
mechanisms are reimplemented in PyTorch.
